    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a variable-width value in a bitcode record. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <computeroutput>Width</computeroutput> parameter should include the continuation bit.</para>
<para>Note that the LLVM bitcode format only supports unsigned values. </para>
